From 7fb0e26f34dec796f1a023dacd5752088566a0a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonas Savulionis <jonas@esnet.lt>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:48:50 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] virtio-blk: version private split indirect snapshots

Reserve snapshot 12.2 for an offered indirect feature. Keep the state layout unchanged and validate the feature, header and destination drive opt-in before constructing a VM. Use the same contract for full snapshots and pre-copy FINAL.

Signed-off-by: Jonas Savulionis <jonas@esnet.lt>
